# This directory stores trained model artefacts.
#
# Files stored here after training:
#   credit_model.pkl        - Champion Logistic Regression pipeline
#   challenger_rf_model.pkl - Random Forest challenger pipeline
#   model_card.json         - Model metadata and evaluation metrics
#
# Run training to generate these files:
#   python src/train_model.py
#
# Note: .pkl files are excluded from version control (.gitignore).
# In production, models are stored in a model registry
# (MLflow, SageMaker Model Registry, or Vertex AI).
